1
00:00:00,804 --> 00:00:02,139
Hey, so, where's Anzu?

2
00:00:02,222 --> 00:00:03,056
#12 LAST STORY!?

3
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:05,142
[Hijiri] She should have been
out here by now.

4
00:00:05,642 --> 00:00:09,229
Huh. I think she was in the break room
last time I saw her.

5
00:00:10,147 --> 00:00:12,149
[suspenseful music]

6
00:00:12,232 --> 00:00:13,316
[Anzu] What was that?

7
00:00:13,817 --> 00:00:16,403
My head hurts. It feels…

8
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,655
[Anzu gasps]

9
00:00:19,156 --> 00:00:20,198
Blood?

10
00:00:22,784 --> 00:00:24,578
I gotta get out of here.

11
00:00:24,661 --> 00:00:26,663
[Yukana] You're just like all the others…

12
00:00:28,123 --> 00:00:30,792
always in my way.

13
00:00:31,418 --> 00:00:32,878
-[door opens]
-[hurried footsteps]

14
00:00:33,545 --> 00:00:34,713
[Arisa] Stop!

15
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:36,757
You're not going alone.

16
00:00:37,632 --> 00:00:39,634
We should split up.
We'll cover more ground.

17
00:00:39,718 --> 00:00:40,802
-Mm-hm.
-Yes.

18
00:00:41,303 --> 00:00:43,096
[Tsuchiya] Mr. Hijiri,
allow me to handle this.

19
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:44,973
You should remain at work.

20
00:00:46,475 --> 00:00:47,726
[door opens]

21
00:00:47,809 --> 00:00:48,935
[Arisa pants]

22
00:00:52,814 --> 00:00:54,566
What did you do, Anzu?

23
00:00:55,192 --> 00:00:58,278
Without my magic, I'm useless to you.

24
00:01:00,113 --> 00:01:02,991
[Arisa and Tsukasa panting]

25
00:01:03,575 --> 00:01:04,493
[gasps]

26
00:01:05,035 --> 00:01:07,037
[tense music]

27
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:09,122
[Tsukasa] Hoshino!

28
00:01:10,707 --> 00:01:12,709
You came for me, my love.

29
00:01:13,543 --> 00:01:14,961
[gasps]

30
00:01:15,045 --> 00:01:16,046
Here.

31
00:01:16,963 --> 00:01:17,964
[gasps]

32
00:01:18,548 --> 00:01:20,467
[Tsukasa grunts in pain]

33
00:01:20,550 --> 00:01:21,676
Hm.

34
00:01:22,761 --> 00:01:24,179
[Yukana] Tsukasa…

35
00:01:24,262 --> 00:01:26,848
[breathing heavily]

36
00:01:27,766 --> 00:01:29,893
I understand. Everyone else is in the way.

37
00:01:31,228 --> 00:01:33,313
None of this is any of your fault.

38
00:01:33,396 --> 00:01:34,314
[gasps]

39
00:01:35,148 --> 00:01:38,485
[Anzu] I would have believed you
even when nobody else did.

40
00:01:40,278 --> 00:01:42,781
How dare you! Get away from Hoshino!

41
00:01:42,864 --> 00:01:44,449
-[slaps]
-[knife clangs]

42
00:01:45,242 --> 00:01:46,701
[Tsukasa exhales heavily]

43
00:01:46,785 --> 00:01:50,080
[Yukana] Tsukasa? But why, my love?

44
00:01:50,163 --> 00:01:52,791
Sh-- Shut up! I am not your love!

45
00:01:52,874 --> 00:01:56,378
Everything you put me through!
And now you go after her!

46
00:01:56,878 --> 00:02:00,966
I never wanna see your face
or hear your voice ever again!

47
00:02:01,049 --> 00:02:02,259
Do you understand me?

48
00:02:02,884 --> 00:02:04,678
Get out of my sight!

49
00:02:06,012 --> 00:02:07,722
[Yukana] There's no need
for such silly lies.

50
00:02:07,806 --> 00:02:08,807
[Tsukasa gasps]

51
00:02:09,599 --> 00:02:10,851
I understand.

52
00:02:11,434 --> 00:02:14,062
No one else will understand you like I do.

53
00:02:14,646 --> 00:02:18,483
My sweet Tsukasa,
I'll love you every minute of every day

54
00:02:18,567 --> 00:02:20,068
for the rest of my life.

55
00:02:20,152 --> 00:02:21,111
[moans]

56
00:02:21,194 --> 00:02:25,031
[Yukana] The sweet boy I know
wouldn't resort to this kind of violence.

57
00:02:25,115 --> 00:02:27,033
I see now. I need to stay by your side.

58
00:02:27,117 --> 00:02:29,661
You have some bad influences.

59
00:02:30,996 --> 00:02:32,080
Hmm?

60
00:02:32,164 --> 00:02:36,626
We make this perfectly clear.
If you keep trying to get to Kazuki,

61
00:02:37,252 --> 00:02:39,296
you're gonna have to go through me first,

62
00:02:39,963 --> 00:02:42,549
because I will always be right here
by his side!

63
00:02:43,049 --> 00:02:46,386
I will never let you get near him,
no matter what!

64
00:02:46,469 --> 00:02:48,722
[siren wailing]

65
00:02:50,807 --> 00:02:51,683
[Anzu groans]

66
00:02:53,059 --> 00:02:54,519
[officer] Are you the one who called?

67
00:02:54,603 --> 00:02:57,188
[Arisa] Yes! That woman is armed
and is extremely dangerous!

68
00:02:57,272 --> 00:03:00,025
-[officer] Call it in! We need an…
-Hey, hey! Hold on!

69
00:03:00,108 --> 00:03:02,360
[siren fading]

70
00:03:02,444 --> 00:03:05,405
TRAFFIC SAFETY PROGRAM NOW ENFORCED

71
00:03:05,488 --> 00:03:06,573
[approaching footsteps]

72
00:03:06,656 --> 00:03:08,450
[gasps]
You're okay.

73
00:03:09,492 --> 00:03:12,495
Hey, guys!
You didn't all need to wait for me.

74
00:03:13,455 --> 00:03:15,415
Anzu, are you all right?

75
00:03:15,498 --> 00:03:18,418
Yeah, turns out
it was just a little scratch.

76
00:03:18,501 --> 00:03:20,337
-Mm. That's a relief.
-[Saki] That's a relief.

77
00:03:20,420 --> 00:03:21,254
[chuckles]

78
00:03:21,338 --> 00:03:22,422
[Tsukasa's dad] Tsukasa.

79
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:26,801
-[Tsukasa's dad clears throat]
-[Tsukasa] Dad, Mom.

80
00:03:30,764 --> 00:03:32,474
Are you Anzu Hoshino?

81
00:03:33,099 --> 00:03:34,142
[Anzu] Yes.

82
00:03:34,226 --> 00:03:37,479
It's my son's fault.
I'm sorry you were involved.

83
00:03:37,562 --> 00:03:39,606
Please accept our sincerest apology.

84
00:03:42,359 --> 00:03:43,485
[breathing nervously]

85
00:03:45,237 --> 00:03:47,030
[grunting]

86
00:03:47,113 --> 00:03:49,532
[Tsukasa groans in pain]
Ow, uh…

87
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:52,369
[Tsukasa's dad] We're all truly sorry.

88
00:03:54,246 --> 00:03:56,289
I understand your parents are out of town.

89
00:03:56,790 --> 00:04:00,210
I would like to apologize
to them as well when they return.

90
00:04:01,086 --> 00:04:03,004
For now, you'll have to excuse us.

91
00:04:03,630 --> 00:04:04,798
[groans]

92
00:04:04,881 --> 00:04:07,175
-[Tsukasa's dad] We're leaving.
-[Tsukasa grunts]

93
00:04:07,259 --> 00:04:08,843
Huh? Uh…

94
00:04:10,887 --> 00:04:12,514
[Tsukasa's dad exclaims]

95
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:15,392
[Anzu] Let's go home, Kazuki.

96
00:04:16,393 --> 00:04:17,435
[grunts]

97
00:04:19,771 --> 00:04:20,897
Hey!

98
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:25,277
Tsukasa needed your support tonight.

99
00:04:25,777 --> 00:04:28,280
But just like before,
you blamed him for everything.

100
00:04:28,780 --> 00:04:30,573
Do you know how hurtful that is?

101
00:04:31,574 --> 00:04:32,742
Aren't you his father?

102
00:04:32,826 --> 00:04:35,161
Of all people, I'd think
you would be the one stepping up

103
00:04:35,245 --> 00:04:36,329
to protect him!

104
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:38,373
Let's go.

105
00:04:40,083 --> 00:04:41,001
[grunts]

106
00:04:41,668 --> 00:04:43,586
[Junta] She's right. We should go.

107
00:04:43,670 --> 00:04:45,505
[groans]
How dare she.

108
00:04:45,588 --> 00:04:47,424
Such disrespectful behavior!

109
00:04:47,507 --> 00:04:48,967
[Arisa laughing]

110
00:04:50,051 --> 00:04:51,136
Stop laughing!

111
00:04:51,219 --> 00:04:52,554
[Tsukasa's mom] Mm, uh…

112
00:04:54,806 --> 00:04:56,933
[Anzu] I told you, Mom, I'm totally fine.

113
00:04:57,767 --> 00:05:00,937
But I can use more cute pics of Momohiki.
Good night.

114
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,356
[door opens]

115
00:05:03,982 --> 00:05:05,942
Mm. So, guess what?

116
00:05:06,026 --> 00:05:08,528
My mom's coming back home.
I tried to tell her

117
00:05:08,611 --> 00:05:11,323
there was nothing to worry about,
but she insisted.

118
00:05:11,406 --> 00:05:12,324
I'm sorry.

119
00:05:15,994 --> 00:05:19,247
Hey, Hoshino, how is it
that you were always saving me?

120
00:05:19,873 --> 00:05:21,583
Huh, I am?

121
00:05:21,666 --> 00:05:22,834
You are.

122
00:05:25,045 --> 00:05:27,047
[soft piano music]

123
00:05:27,964 --> 00:05:28,923
[phone chimes]

124
00:05:31,384 --> 00:05:33,303
[Ayami] Hey, Tsukasa, how you've been?

125
00:05:33,386 --> 00:05:35,221
Did you hear about
the junior high reunion?

126
00:05:35,305 --> 00:05:38,058
You'd better come.
It's been way too long, I miss you.

127
00:05:38,141 --> 00:05:40,477
[girl 1] Where you've been lately?
I miss you.

128
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,936
[girl 2] So, got a girlfriend yet?

129
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:43,104
[girl 3] Tsukasa, it's me.

130
00:05:45,273 --> 00:05:46,524
[gags]

131
00:05:51,613 --> 00:05:52,530
-Ah…
-Oh…

132
00:05:52,614 --> 00:05:53,948
[phone clatters]

133
00:05:55,450 --> 00:05:58,161
[yelps]
I'm so sorry!

134
00:05:58,953 --> 00:06:01,956
[Tsukasa sighs]
That's a pretty good crack.

135
00:06:02,499 --> 00:06:05,460
I'm so sorry.
Please, let me pay to fix it.

136
00:06:05,543 --> 00:06:07,712
[Tsukasa] You don't have to pay
for the repairs.

137
00:06:08,546 --> 00:06:11,674
Well, then, thanks. Thanks a lot!

138
00:06:12,258 --> 00:06:15,136
I'm sorry, uh, I bumped you! Goodbye!

139
00:06:15,220 --> 00:06:16,387
[Anzu wailing]

140
00:06:16,971 --> 00:06:17,847
Uh…

141
00:06:19,099 --> 00:06:19,974
[chuckles softly]

142
00:06:23,269 --> 00:06:25,480
[Anzu grunting]

143
00:06:26,439 --> 00:06:27,482
Huh?

144
00:06:28,942 --> 00:06:30,944
[eerie chuckle]

145
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:36,074
Uh, hey, are you okay?

146
00:06:36,908 --> 00:06:38,868
-[sighs]
-[Makoto] Come on, don't just stand there,

147
00:06:38,952 --> 00:06:42,622
-help her up!
-All good! I'm totally fine!

148
00:06:43,665 --> 00:06:44,791
[doors clank]

149
00:06:44,874 --> 00:06:46,167
[both] One set A.

150
00:06:46,251 --> 00:06:47,502
-Huh?
-Um…

151
00:06:48,169 --> 00:06:49,879
[Anzu groans]

152
00:06:55,176 --> 00:06:56,261
-Hey.
-[shrieks]

153
00:06:57,011 --> 00:06:59,848
[Tsukasa] I get the feeling
she's gonna be just fine.

154
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:04,769
SHUKAN HIGH INDUCTION CEREMONY

155
00:07:04,853 --> 00:07:06,855
Hey! Better hurry, Kazuki's leaving.

156
00:07:06,938 --> 00:07:09,774
He's too fast. I gotta catch up with him!

157
00:07:09,858 --> 00:07:11,860
[Tsukasa] I'd better go straight home.

158
00:07:14,362 --> 00:07:15,947
-[Rena] Kazuki!
-[Tsukasa] Please just stop.

159
00:07:16,030 --> 00:07:17,282
Leave me alone.

160
00:07:18,575 --> 00:07:20,160
-[thuds]
-[Anzu] Whoa! Sorry!

161
00:07:20,243 --> 00:07:21,911
-[Tsukasa] Huh?
-[Rena] Oh hey, watch out.

162
00:07:21,995 --> 00:07:24,747
-My bad, sorry! In a hurry!
-Uh?

163
00:07:26,708 --> 00:07:30,128
Hey, Kazuki!

164
00:07:31,171 --> 00:07:33,506
[Tsukasa] From the first time
you caught my eye…

165
00:07:35,717 --> 00:07:39,012
Out of respect for my friend,
I can't help.

166
00:07:39,637 --> 00:07:40,930
Thanks for inviting me along.

167
00:07:41,014 --> 00:07:44,934
-[Tsukasa] You've always…
-But you've been a real lifesaver for me.

168
00:07:45,643 --> 00:07:47,812
[Tsukasa] …known exactly
the right thing to say.

169
00:07:49,272 --> 00:07:51,524
You're always saving me.

170
00:07:52,650 --> 00:07:53,985
[phone chimes]

171
00:07:54,569 --> 00:07:56,613
[Anzu] Huh? Yes!

172
00:07:56,696 --> 00:08:00,992
Mom just sent a ton of Momohiki pics!
[squeals]

173
00:08:01,075 --> 00:08:03,620
[Anzu chuckles]
Mwah!

174
00:08:03,703 --> 00:08:05,872
Stop me if you hate this.

175
00:08:07,790 --> 00:08:08,791
[Anzu] Uh…

176
00:08:09,375 --> 00:08:11,044
[Tsukasa] Somewhere along the way,

177
00:08:11,127 --> 00:08:13,213
you became really important to me.

178
00:08:16,549 --> 00:08:17,383
[Tsukasa] Thank you.

179
00:08:18,635 --> 00:08:19,469
[Anzu sighs]

180
00:08:20,553 --> 00:08:23,181
[Anzu] But of course!
What are friends for?

181
00:08:23,264 --> 00:08:25,266
[tender music]

182
00:08:27,018 --> 00:08:27,977
[sighs]

183
00:08:32,148 --> 00:08:33,983
[yawns]
I'm so thirsty.

184
00:08:34,776 --> 00:08:35,944
Didn't know you were up.

185
00:08:36,027 --> 00:08:37,278
[door squeaks]

186
00:08:40,281 --> 00:08:43,243
-[thuds]
-[Junta groans]

187
00:08:43,326 --> 00:08:45,828
[sobs]
Sorry, I interrupted!

188
00:08:45,912 --> 00:08:47,205
It's not like that!

189
00:08:48,081 --> 00:08:50,208
[Miyoko] My little Anzu!

190
00:08:50,291 --> 00:08:53,545
I know you don't always act like it,
but you are a girl.

191
00:08:53,628 --> 00:08:56,089
You can't afford to have
a scar on your face.

192
00:08:56,172 --> 00:08:59,217
Now it's gonna be even harder for you
to attract your soulmate.

193
00:08:59,300 --> 00:09:00,677
-[Anzu] Mom, stop it.
-[whines]

194
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,428
[Arisa] There's no need
to worry about that.

195
00:09:02,512 --> 00:09:04,305
A true soulmate can see past your scars.

196
00:09:04,389 --> 00:09:07,600
Besides, she practically proposed
to Tsukasa already.

197
00:09:07,684 --> 00:09:08,518
Arisa!

198
00:09:09,018 --> 00:09:10,562
I will always be at his side!

199
00:09:10,645 --> 00:09:11,563
Ooh!

200
00:09:11,646 --> 00:09:13,856
You've got the wrong idea!
I didn't mean it like that!

201
00:09:14,732 --> 00:09:16,484
Speaking of boys, where's Junta?

202
00:09:16,568 --> 00:09:17,569
[Anzu] Baseball practice.

203
00:09:17,652 --> 00:09:20,738
[Miyoko] I haven't seen him in a while.
I was looking forward to catching up.

204
00:09:20,822 --> 00:09:23,283
Well, speaking of catching up,
did Dad come too?

205
00:09:23,366 --> 00:09:26,578
[Miyoko] Someone has to stay and take care
of Momohiki. He drew the short straw.

206
00:09:26,661 --> 00:09:28,079
You just left him, huh?

207
00:09:30,498 --> 00:09:33,042
I'm really curious.
How will they punish her?

208
00:09:33,710 --> 00:09:35,503
The authorities need to do something.

209
00:09:35,587 --> 00:09:38,673
This whole situation
has become such a nightmare.

210
00:09:39,299 --> 00:09:40,550
[Arisa] It's just so concerning

211
00:09:40,633 --> 00:09:44,178
because I know how persistent
that girl has always been in the past.

212
00:09:51,311 --> 00:09:53,688
What do you mean you can't cover
for her anymore?

213
00:09:53,771 --> 00:09:55,732
What are we supposed to do?

214
00:09:55,815 --> 00:09:58,234
[Yukana's uncle]
I've said all I can about it.

215
00:09:58,318 --> 00:10:00,570
-[hangs up]
-[Yukana's mom] Wait! Hello?

216
00:10:01,904 --> 00:10:02,780
[sighs]

217
00:10:03,656 --> 00:10:07,452
[Yukana's uncle] Again, I'm terribly sorry
for the trouble my niece has caused.

218
00:10:07,952 --> 00:10:08,870
It's fine.

219
00:10:09,454 --> 00:10:12,582
However, if she attempts
to hurt my friends again…

220
00:10:14,083 --> 00:10:15,835
Do we understand each other?

221
00:10:15,918 --> 00:10:17,920
[suspenseful music]

222
00:10:19,547 --> 00:10:21,007
[Riri] Attaboy, Hijiri.

223
00:10:21,507 --> 00:10:24,552
Way to go, putting
those family connections to good use.

224
00:10:24,636 --> 00:10:26,137
I was counting on you.

225
00:10:27,221 --> 00:10:31,476
Unfortunately, I don't think
this punishment is gonna cut it.

226
00:10:37,523 --> 00:10:38,441
[water plops]

227
00:10:39,484 --> 00:10:41,903
[Yukana] Separated from my love
once again.

228
00:10:43,029 --> 00:10:44,614
But do not fear, my sweet.

229
00:10:45,156 --> 00:10:47,492
We are destined to be together.

230
00:10:48,534 --> 00:10:51,412
I am the only one who can save you
from all those people,

231
00:10:51,996 --> 00:10:53,539
who want to keep us apart.

232
00:10:53,623 --> 00:10:55,416
-[Riri] Good evening.
-[gasps]

233
00:10:55,500 --> 00:10:56,417
Huh?

234
00:10:57,168 --> 00:10:58,086
Who are you?

235
00:10:59,712 --> 00:11:02,924
Well, hey there! The name's Riri.
I'm a wizard.

236
00:11:03,508 --> 00:11:05,551
Sadly, my wand's been
out of order for a bit,

237
00:11:05,635 --> 00:11:08,096
and I haven't been able to use my magic.

238
00:11:08,846 --> 00:11:10,348
Are you crazy?

239
00:11:10,848 --> 00:11:14,227
That's funny.
I was gonna ask you the same thing.

240
00:11:14,310 --> 00:11:16,312
[ominous music]

241
00:11:17,730 --> 00:11:18,648
[gasps in fear]

242
00:11:25,363 --> 00:11:29,659
[Anzu] It's kinda strange. I haven't heard
a peep from Riri since the incident.

243
00:11:30,368 --> 00:11:31,744
At last!

244
00:11:31,828 --> 00:11:36,040
[mumbling]
It's finally happening. You missed me.

245
00:11:36,124 --> 00:11:37,667
No! Did not!

246
00:11:38,209 --> 00:11:39,585
What do you want anyway?

247
00:11:39,669 --> 00:11:42,547
[Riri] I know you called.
My Anzu senses were tingling.

248
00:11:42,630 --> 00:11:43,589
[giggles]

249
00:11:44,173 --> 00:11:45,049
[sighs]

250
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:48,010
[Rio] Oh, I get it.
You were hoping to get to see…

251
00:11:49,053 --> 00:11:50,346
this version of me, huh?

252
00:11:50,430 --> 00:11:52,014
-I didn't call!
-[yelps]

253
00:11:52,098 --> 00:11:53,641
And no matter what form you're in,

254
00:11:53,724 --> 00:11:55,643
you still look like
the world's biggest piece of crap!

255
00:11:55,726 --> 00:11:57,520
Such flowery language!

256
00:11:58,438 --> 00:12:01,649
I just came to tell you
you don't have anything to worry about.

257
00:12:02,316 --> 00:12:04,444
Your troubles have all vanished!

258
00:12:04,527 --> 00:12:06,696
Now you can just focus on being you.

259
00:12:07,530 --> 00:12:09,115
And don't ever change, okay?

260
00:12:11,284 --> 00:12:12,285
I love you.

261
00:12:12,869 --> 00:12:13,744
[kisses]

262
00:12:16,747 --> 00:12:20,585
-[Anzu] You bastard! Get over here!
-[Rio yelps]

263
00:12:21,544 --> 00:12:23,171
[Rio] That was close! Here you go!

264
00:12:23,254 --> 00:12:24,130
[Anzu huffs]

265
00:12:24,630 --> 00:12:27,550
[chuckles]
Well, that was fun, but I gotta go!

266
00:12:28,426 --> 00:12:30,136
Goodbye, Anzu.

267
00:12:32,472 --> 00:12:35,349
Wait! What the heck was that about?

268
00:12:35,850 --> 00:12:37,852
[birds chirping]

269
00:12:37,935 --> 00:12:40,021
[Anzu] What? She lost her memory?

270
00:12:41,022 --> 00:12:43,816
Yeah, at least
that's what her lawyer said.

271
00:12:44,358 --> 00:12:46,319
Kishi seems to have suffered
some sort of break,

272
00:12:46,402 --> 00:12:47,862
resulting in a loss of memory.

273
00:12:48,362 --> 00:12:50,406
She can't remember anything
from the past few years,

274
00:12:50,490 --> 00:12:51,616
including Tsukasa.

275
00:12:52,533 --> 00:12:54,785
Are they sure this girl isn't lying?

276
00:12:54,869 --> 00:12:56,954
[Arisa] The doctors seem to believe
it's the truth.

277
00:12:57,788 --> 00:12:59,916
Well, that's good news, then.
You should be relieved.

278
00:12:59,999 --> 00:13:02,418
You can finally go back
to living your life without fear.

279
00:13:03,127 --> 00:13:06,714
I guess. It's so sudden,
it doesn't feel real yet.

280
00:13:07,715 --> 00:13:09,550
[Anzu] Take all the time you need
to process it.

281
00:13:09,634 --> 00:13:10,635
Huh?

282
00:13:10,718 --> 00:13:11,594
[soft chuckle]

283
00:13:14,430 --> 00:13:15,348
Yeah.

284
00:13:17,183 --> 00:13:19,185
Anzu!

285
00:13:19,268 --> 00:13:20,978
-Dad! You're here!
-Ah! You're here!

286
00:13:21,687 --> 00:13:23,940
[Anzu's dad] I was worried about you,
I couldn't stay away

287
00:13:24,023 --> 00:13:26,192
while I knew my little girl
was going through such a rough time.

288
00:13:26,275 --> 00:13:29,070
Plus, check out all these sweet gifts
I brought back

289
00:13:29,153 --> 00:13:31,322
just for you to help cheer you up!

290
00:13:31,405 --> 00:13:33,282
[Anzu] Games and chocolate!

291
00:13:33,783 --> 00:13:35,201
[pig snorts]

292
00:13:35,284 --> 00:13:37,745
And don't forget the special pork buns.

293
00:13:37,828 --> 00:13:41,290
Pork buns? Hold on,
weren't they relocated to the US?

294
00:13:41,374 --> 00:13:43,501
-[Anzu's dad] And last but not least…
-[meows]

295
00:13:43,584 --> 00:13:45,169
[Anzu] Momohiki!

296
00:13:45,253 --> 00:13:48,047
Momohiki! Momohiki! Momohiki!
[smooches, exclaims]

297
00:13:48,130 --> 00:13:51,300
-Missed you so much!
-[meows]

298
00:13:51,884 --> 00:13:54,720
[Anzu] Hey.
Games, chocolate, and my Momohiki?

299
00:13:54,804 --> 00:13:58,349
My three greatest desires,
all suddenly back at once?

300
00:13:58,432 --> 00:14:00,268
What the heck does this mean?

301
00:14:01,686 --> 00:14:04,480
[insects chirruping]

302
00:14:05,064 --> 00:14:07,108
[Anzu] Don't you wanna sleep
in the office with Dad?

303
00:14:07,858 --> 00:14:10,152
He snores so loudly after traveling.

304
00:14:10,236 --> 00:14:11,571
Oh.

305
00:14:11,654 --> 00:14:13,948
[snoring loudly]

306
00:14:17,034 --> 00:14:18,995
Maybe I should just go home.

307
00:14:19,871 --> 00:14:21,956
Why? Her mom said you could stay, right?

308
00:14:22,039 --> 00:14:24,375
Yeah, but I don't wanna sleep
in the same room as you.

309
00:14:24,458 --> 00:14:26,127
Wow, way to sugarcoat it.

310
00:14:27,795 --> 00:14:29,505
-[Tsukasa] Hey.
-Huh?

311
00:14:30,882 --> 00:14:33,509
[Tsukasa] I have to be honest
with you about something.

312
00:14:35,219 --> 00:14:39,015
You know, uh, how I said before
that I didn't like Anzu in that way.

313
00:14:40,016 --> 00:14:41,309
Well, things have changed.

314
00:14:42,476 --> 00:14:44,395
What I'm trying to say--

315
00:14:44,478 --> 00:14:46,022
-[Junta] I know, all right?
-[gasps]

316
00:14:46,606 --> 00:14:47,607
[Tsukasa] What?

317
00:14:47,690 --> 00:14:50,026
[Junta] Anzu's always been
one of the coolest people I know,

318
00:14:50,109 --> 00:14:51,944
so I can see how you'd fall for her.

319
00:14:52,445 --> 00:14:54,280
[Tsukasa] So, you're okay with it?

320
00:14:54,947 --> 00:14:58,117
Oh, wait! That means that…
[sighs]

321
00:14:58,200 --> 00:15:00,494
[Junta] …now I have to worry
about competing with you.

322
00:15:01,078 --> 00:15:03,581
Not only that, but Ryuya as well.

323
00:15:03,664 --> 00:15:06,584
Man, you do really have
low self-esteem, don't you?

324
00:15:08,377 --> 00:15:09,962
You shouldn't worry too much.

325
00:15:10,546 --> 00:15:13,007
I only just started feeling comfortable
around her.

326
00:15:13,591 --> 00:15:15,718
Plus, she only thinks of me as a friend.

327
00:15:16,218 --> 00:15:17,094
Huh?

328
00:15:18,095 --> 00:15:20,097
What? Pretty sure
you're in the friend zone too.

329
00:15:20,181 --> 00:15:22,350
Hey! You don't have to rub it in!

330
00:15:22,934 --> 00:15:26,228
Whatever. I only told you
'cause we're housemates.

331
00:15:26,896 --> 00:15:28,814
Feels weird sharing this kind of stuff.

332
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:31,442
Let's never talk about it again.

333
00:15:31,525 --> 00:15:32,860
It's fine by me.

334
00:15:33,444 --> 00:15:34,362
[soft chuckle]

335
00:15:35,696 --> 00:15:36,864
Hmm.

336
00:15:36,948 --> 00:15:40,576
[Anzu] I'm not sleepy at all,
so I'm just gonna go downstairs.

337
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:42,912
[Tsukasa] I'm not tired.
I think I'll go downstairs too.

338
00:15:42,995 --> 00:15:45,331
Huh? No way. How is that fair?

339
00:15:45,414 --> 00:15:46,916
Wait up, I'm coming too.

340
00:15:47,917 --> 00:15:50,211
You've got practice
in the morning, remember?

341
00:15:50,294 --> 00:15:52,672
[Junta] There's no way
I'm leaving the two of you alone.

342
00:15:53,255 --> 00:15:55,383
I still cry just thinking
about the last time

343
00:15:55,466 --> 00:15:57,760
when you got to hug her!
[whines]

344
00:15:57,843 --> 00:15:59,679
[Tsukasa] Pull yourself together.

345
00:16:02,765 --> 00:16:05,559
Riri, explain yourself!

346
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:07,395
Get out here, right now!

347
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:12,108
-[Kate] I'm afraid that Riri's not coming.
-What?

348
00:16:15,194 --> 00:16:17,154
[Anzu] And, you are…

349
00:16:18,197 --> 00:16:20,241
Sorry to show up out of the blue.

350
00:16:20,324 --> 00:16:22,410
My name's Kate and I'm a wizard.

351
00:16:22,493 --> 00:16:24,829
I'm sort of the new wizard in charge.

352
00:16:24,912 --> 00:16:26,831
New wizard in charge?

353
00:16:27,873 --> 00:16:31,836
'Fraid so, since Riri's not allowed
in the human world.

354
00:16:32,837 --> 00:16:34,046
[Anzu] They're not?

355
00:16:34,130 --> 00:16:35,172
-[Junta] Anzu?
-Huh?

356
00:16:35,256 --> 00:16:36,257
-[Kate] Uh?
-[Junta gasps]

357
00:16:36,340 --> 00:16:37,925
[Junta screams]
What's that?

358
00:16:38,009 --> 00:16:40,428
-What's with the floating doll?
-[grumbles]

359
00:16:41,012 --> 00:16:43,889
Wait, can you guys see that thing too?

360
00:16:44,390 --> 00:16:45,558
[both] Mm-hm.

361
00:16:46,434 --> 00:16:49,353
-What is this, furball?
-[Kate] My name's Kate.

362
00:16:49,437 --> 00:16:52,481
I don't care what your name is!
Your magic's busted, fix it!

363
00:16:52,565 --> 00:16:56,360
Not again! I blew it!
I forgot to use an illusion spell!

364
00:16:56,444 --> 00:16:58,279
You're useless, you know that!

365
00:16:58,362 --> 00:17:00,698
Cut me a little slack, will ya?
[groans]

366
00:17:00,781 --> 00:17:03,159
This whole day has been
pretty hectic for me too!

367
00:17:03,242 --> 00:17:04,702
-It's talking…
-It's talking…

368
00:17:04,785 --> 00:17:07,038
[playful music]

369
00:17:07,121 --> 00:17:10,207
[Tsukasa] I don't know.
That story's pretty far-fetched,

370
00:17:10,291 --> 00:17:13,044
even with the wizard
sitting right there in front of me.

371
00:17:13,544 --> 00:17:17,173
Although when I think about it,
it actually explains a lot.

372
00:17:17,256 --> 00:17:18,090
PIERCING BRANCH

373
00:17:19,383 --> 00:17:20,676
SOAKING-WET ROOM

374
00:17:21,552 --> 00:17:25,890
So, then, our reunion
was sped up to fit its timeline?

375
00:17:26,390 --> 00:17:29,685
Man, how did I not notice
something like that?

376
00:17:30,436 --> 00:17:34,273
I'm really sorry, you guys. I didn't mean
for you to get mixed up in this.

377
00:17:34,356 --> 00:17:38,235
It's so embarrassing to be
subject number one for this stupid thing.

378
00:17:38,736 --> 00:17:40,946
You've got nothing to apologize for.

379
00:17:41,739 --> 00:17:43,741
I'm sure this has been hardest on you.

380
00:17:44,366 --> 00:17:47,369
Besides, meeting you is what saved me.

381
00:17:47,870 --> 00:17:49,455
So please don't apologize.

382
00:17:49,538 --> 00:17:51,123
[Junta] I feel the same.

383
00:17:51,624 --> 00:17:54,085
I don't care how.
I'm just glad we're reunited.

384
00:17:54,585 --> 00:17:57,213
Junta, Kazuki.

385
00:17:59,173 --> 00:18:03,260
Though, I really don't like
the idea of a forced romance.

386
00:18:03,344 --> 00:18:07,181
Don't blame me. Both Riri and I
are just cogs in the corporate machine,

387
00:18:07,264 --> 00:18:08,182
just following orders.

388
00:18:08,265 --> 00:18:09,975
[gasps]
Hang on.

389
00:18:10,059 --> 00:18:12,853
[Anzu] What do you mean,
they can't come back to this world?

390
00:18:12,937 --> 00:18:16,524
Riri broke the rules and used taboo magic.

391
00:18:16,607 --> 00:18:17,525
[Tsukasa] Taboo?

392
00:18:17,608 --> 00:18:20,528
[Kate] 'Fraid so. They use
their magic to erase the memories

393
00:18:20,611 --> 00:18:23,614
of Kazuki's stalker
for their own personal reasons.

394
00:18:24,156 --> 00:18:25,908
But why? Why'd they do that?

395
00:18:27,451 --> 00:18:31,413
Anzu's fault! The higher-ups thought
Riri developed feelings for Anzu

396
00:18:31,497 --> 00:18:33,165
that went beyond the professional bounds.

397
00:18:34,041 --> 00:18:37,128
[Kate] Remember when you were
attacked by those two men in the alley?

398
00:18:37,211 --> 00:18:38,921
All of your friends
just randomly showed up.

399
00:18:39,505 --> 00:18:42,675
[Anzu] Right, everyone arrived
after receiving those texts.

400
00:18:43,968 --> 00:18:46,220
That interference was Riri's first strike.

401
00:18:46,303 --> 00:18:47,805
They really crossed the line.

402
00:18:47,888 --> 00:18:50,933
You see, we have very strict rules
about using our magic.

403
00:18:51,016 --> 00:18:54,520
It must be used only for the development
of romantic relationships.

404
00:18:56,105 --> 00:18:58,357
[Anzu] So, what's going to happen to Riri?

405
00:18:58,858 --> 00:19:01,068
[Kate] Capital punishment
of the magic world.

406
00:19:01,152 --> 00:19:02,444
[Anzu, Tsukasa and Junta] What?

407
00:19:03,154 --> 00:19:06,115
It's usually what would happen,
but not this time.

408
00:19:06,198 --> 00:19:07,366
The company was lenient,

409
00:19:07,449 --> 00:19:10,619
and instead, settled for a life sentence
of cleaning the basement.

410
00:19:11,370 --> 00:19:12,788
Life sentence?

411
00:19:12,872 --> 00:19:16,876
I see. So they didn't want anyone
to know about Riri's actions.

412
00:19:16,959 --> 00:19:17,960
Avoid the scandal.

413
00:19:18,043 --> 00:19:20,880
[Kate] Of course.
The company has a reputation to maintain.

414
00:19:20,963 --> 00:19:22,590
They'd agree on almost anything.

415
00:19:22,673 --> 00:19:25,009
That's how Riri was able
to negotiate getting you back

416
00:19:25,092 --> 00:19:27,219
your three greatest desires
as part of their deal.

417
00:19:27,303 --> 00:19:28,470
Any more questions?

418
00:19:28,971 --> 00:19:32,516
[Anzu] Nope, I think I understand
everything. Thanks for the insight, Kate.

419
00:19:33,100 --> 00:19:35,519
Of course. I look forward
to working with you--

420
00:19:35,603 --> 00:19:36,437
[Anzu grunts]

421
00:19:36,520 --> 00:19:38,522
[action music]

422
00:19:38,606 --> 00:19:43,527
[screams]

423
00:19:45,946 --> 00:19:47,114
[Kate] Hey, wait! Oh…

424
00:19:47,698 --> 00:19:51,702
What do you think you're doing?
Give me back my wand!

425
00:19:52,203 --> 00:19:54,997
You're gonna let me see Riri right now.

426
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:56,498
If I remember correctly,

427
00:19:56,582 --> 00:19:59,543
you can't use your magic
if your wand is contaminated.

428
00:20:00,169 --> 00:20:01,337
[Kate] You wouldn't…

429
00:20:01,420 --> 00:20:04,006
[Anzu] Imagine the trouble you'll be in
when your bosses find out

430
00:20:04,089 --> 00:20:06,592
that on your first day,
you exposed yourself to humans,

431
00:20:06,675 --> 00:20:08,844
and reveal the details
of your secret mission.

432
00:20:09,428 --> 00:20:12,097
Add to that, wand contamination.

433
00:20:12,681 --> 00:20:15,392
And just so you know,
my dad's been in here tonight,

434
00:20:15,476 --> 00:20:17,853
and it wasn't pretty!

435
00:20:17,937 --> 00:20:19,396
[whimpers]

436
00:20:20,898 --> 00:20:22,024
[button clicks]

437
00:20:23,442 --> 00:20:25,861
Your little stunt cost me my bonus.

438
00:20:25,945 --> 00:20:28,948
My bosses agreed to 15 minutes
with Riri now.

439
00:20:29,615 --> 00:20:31,617
That's what I'm talking about.

440
00:20:31,700 --> 00:20:34,411
Yeah, no kidding.
That's how you play hardball.

441
00:20:35,621 --> 00:20:37,456
[Kate] Stand back. I'm gonna summon Riri.

442
00:20:37,539 --> 00:20:41,418
-[magical chimes]
-Go! Roma-roma! Kira-kira!

443
00:20:41,502 --> 00:20:43,045
-[thuds]
-[groans]

444
00:20:45,673 --> 00:20:46,590
-[slaps]
-[Riri groans]

445
00:20:48,425 --> 00:20:50,427
Kate! Do you have to be so rough?

446
00:20:50,511 --> 00:20:52,221
[whimpers]
Sorry.

447
00:20:52,304 --> 00:20:54,515
-[Anzu] Riri.
-[gasps, chuckles]

448
00:20:55,099 --> 00:20:56,433
[Riri] Anzu!

449
00:20:56,517 --> 00:20:58,602
Could you transform for me?

450
00:21:01,689 --> 00:21:03,774
What, what is it?

451
00:21:05,818 --> 00:21:08,529
[sighs in relief]
That's much better.

452
00:21:10,072 --> 00:21:14,451
-How dare you disappear on me like that?
-Stop, stop!

453
00:21:14,535 --> 00:21:16,495
-Let go!
-[growls]

454
00:21:18,122 --> 00:21:21,625
[Rio] You may not like it,
but everything Kate told you is true.

455
00:21:22,501 --> 00:21:26,797
This is goodbye forever. After this,
I'll never be allowed to see you again.

456
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:31,302
But hey, you'll be fine. I mean,
I was only in your way, right, Anzu?

457
00:21:32,094 --> 00:21:33,262
So…
[Rio sobs]

458
00:21:34,346 --> 00:21:35,431
[Anzu] Thank you.

459
00:21:35,514 --> 00:21:36,473
[gasps]

460
00:21:38,267 --> 00:21:41,603
Seriously, you left
before I could say it, moron.

461
00:21:42,771 --> 00:21:46,400
I'm sure an ordinary heroine
would have said that with more poise.

462
00:21:48,152 --> 00:21:51,155
Too bad for you,
I'll always be an Anti-Heroine.

463
00:21:52,323 --> 00:21:54,491
[Tsukasa] You know,
she's not the only one.

464
00:21:55,075 --> 00:21:56,285
Thank you, Rio.

465
00:21:57,786 --> 00:22:00,039
Kazuki, no. You and Anzu,

466
00:22:01,165 --> 00:22:04,335
you guys shouldn't thank me for anything.

467
00:22:04,835 --> 00:22:06,211
I messed up.

468
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:09,214
I broke the rules and ruined everything.

469
00:22:10,758 --> 00:22:13,344
And now that you've got
your three greatest desires back,

470
00:22:13,886 --> 00:22:16,680
you can just forget about me,
like a bad dream.

471
00:22:17,431 --> 00:22:18,557
Are you dense?

472
00:22:19,933 --> 00:22:23,854
That's nuts! Do you really think
I'd choose things over my friends?

473
00:22:24,438 --> 00:22:26,732
Never! I would never forget about you.

474
00:22:26,815 --> 00:22:28,358
So what is it you want?

475
00:22:28,859 --> 00:22:29,818
Huh?

476
00:22:30,319 --> 00:22:33,322
[Anzu] I'm asking you, Riri,
what do you want to do?

477
00:22:33,947 --> 00:22:34,823
[Rio] Uh…

478
00:22:36,742 --> 00:22:38,577
Anzu, what I want…

479
00:22:39,244 --> 00:22:40,120
[Rio sobs]

480
00:22:40,704 --> 00:22:41,747
…is to be…

481
00:22:42,706 --> 00:22:44,041
here by your side!

482
00:22:45,459 --> 00:22:46,335
[soft chuckle]

483
00:22:47,044 --> 00:22:49,588
Then stay with me. It's that easy.

484
00:22:49,671 --> 00:22:51,673
[tender music]

485
00:22:52,424 --> 00:22:53,342
[Rio] Okay.

486
00:22:55,886 --> 00:22:59,723
Oh, Anzu!
[cries]

487
00:22:59,807 --> 00:23:01,975
[crying continues]

488
00:23:02,059 --> 00:23:05,062
[Kate] So, hey, um,
are you guys almost done here?

489
00:23:05,145 --> 00:23:07,147
'Cause we really need to wrap this up.

490
00:23:07,856 --> 00:23:10,150
Hey, Furball! Read the room!

491
00:23:10,234 --> 00:23:12,736
[Kate] I told you I'm Kate, not Furball!

492
00:23:12,820 --> 00:23:14,154
Whatever!

493
00:23:14,238 --> 00:23:19,243
Besides, Riri's not going anywhere.
Use your magic so they can stay for good.

494
00:23:19,743 --> 00:23:22,913
I can't do that!
Like I said, magic can only be used…

495
00:23:22,996 --> 00:23:26,250
[both] …if it contributes
to any romantic relationships!

496
00:23:26,750 --> 00:23:28,794
That's right. Finally, she gets it.

497
00:23:28,877 --> 00:23:29,962
[Anzu] Well.

498
00:23:30,504 --> 00:23:34,466
What if I told you there's
a 0.00001 percent chance

499
00:23:34,550 --> 00:23:37,261
that I'd fall for Rio,
making him my potential mate?

500
00:23:38,053 --> 00:23:41,181
Rio? Wait! Oh…

501
00:23:41,765 --> 00:23:43,267
[Junta and Tsukasa] Anzu?

502
00:23:44,893 --> 00:23:47,855
As the wizard in charge,
you're making sure that I fall in love.

503
00:23:47,938 --> 00:23:50,190
You can't separate me
from a potential mate.

504
00:23:50,274 --> 00:23:52,484
-That'll break some rules, right?
-[Rio groans]

505
00:23:53,068 --> 00:23:55,320
-[Anzu] Therefore…
-[whimpers]

506
00:23:56,321 --> 00:24:01,368
It's completely and totally legal for you
to use your magic to keep Rio here!

507
00:24:01,451 --> 00:24:02,786
-Wow.
-Whoa.

508
00:24:03,287 --> 00:24:04,872
What?

509
00:24:04,955 --> 00:24:06,373
Okay, fine then.

510
00:24:06,456 --> 00:24:10,085
This is bad. I'm gonna get
such a pay cut for this.

511
00:24:11,253 --> 00:24:13,630
-You really are the queen of debate!
-[chuckles mischievously]

512
00:24:14,131 --> 00:24:16,967
[Anzu] Huh. Don't go getting
the wrong idea or anything.

513
00:24:17,050 --> 00:24:20,429
I'm not cooperating with your project
and I'm not losing this game.

514
00:24:22,055 --> 00:24:23,807
[gasps]
Neither am I.

515
00:24:24,308 --> 00:24:26,393
I won't lose! Bring it on!

516
00:24:28,562 --> 00:24:32,191
[Anzu] Once things calmed down,
my parents left again to go back to work.

517
00:24:33,775 --> 00:24:36,695
[yawns]
I'm sleepy.

518
00:24:36,778 --> 00:24:39,198
I was up way too late playing games.

519
00:24:39,281 --> 00:24:42,075
[Anzu] And the three of us
continued living together.

520
00:24:42,993 --> 00:24:45,871
The boss was nearly impossible to beat.

521
00:24:45,954 --> 00:24:47,206
Don't fall asleep. You'll trip.

522
00:24:47,789 --> 00:24:48,707
[Anzu] Yeah, yeah.

523
00:24:48,790 --> 00:24:51,084
[Junta] Leave it to Anzu
to sleepwalk to school.

524
00:24:52,419 --> 00:24:53,545
Huh?

525
00:24:54,463 --> 00:24:56,632
[Hijiri] Good morning, my fellow students.

526
00:24:57,633 --> 00:24:59,468
The new semester begins.

527
00:24:59,551 --> 00:25:03,055
It must be a treat for you three
to get to be in my presence daily.

528
00:25:03,138 --> 00:25:03,972
Huh?

529
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:08,018
We're just so grateful. You're a delight.

530
00:25:08,101 --> 00:25:10,729
By the way,
thanks for pulling some strings.

531
00:25:10,812 --> 00:25:13,148
-Now Kishi's family will stop--
-Who told you that?

532
00:25:13,232 --> 00:25:14,066
Tsuchiya.

533
00:25:14,566 --> 00:25:16,485
Mm-mm. Mm-mm. Mm-mm. Mm-mm…

534
00:25:17,069 --> 00:25:19,738
[Anzu] It's admirable to do
such a good deed without showing off.

535
00:25:19,821 --> 00:25:23,075
I-- I don't care
what you plebs think of me.

536
00:25:23,158 --> 00:25:24,993
Again with this hot and cold act?

537
00:25:31,166 --> 00:25:33,794
I don't know
if I've said this before, but,

538
00:25:33,877 --> 00:25:37,422
I really appreciate our time together
on these walks to school.

539
00:25:37,506 --> 00:25:38,590
What?

540
00:25:38,674 --> 00:25:40,676
Uh, wait, did that sound weird?

541
00:25:41,176 --> 00:25:43,095
Not at all. It's very sweet.

542
00:25:43,178 --> 00:25:46,181
-[chuckles awkwardly]
-[Tsukasa] Could he be any more obvious?

543
00:25:47,182 --> 00:25:50,477
[Anzu] I suppose I don't have
to actively avoid romance anymore,

544
00:25:50,560 --> 00:25:53,647
since I did get
all of my things back, right?

545
00:25:53,730 --> 00:25:56,066
-[Riri] Good morning!
-Huh?

546
00:25:56,608 --> 00:25:58,860
-[Riri laughs happily]
-[Anzu] What? She's back?

547
00:26:01,321 --> 00:26:02,155
[Anzu groans]

548
00:26:02,239 --> 00:26:04,032
I'm here to tell you about the new rules.

549
00:26:04,533 --> 00:26:06,034
The new rules?

550
00:26:06,618 --> 00:26:10,998
Yep! You see, your games, chocolate,
and cat may have been returned for now,

551
00:26:11,581 --> 00:26:14,710
but, unless you start prioritizing
romantic relationships,

552
00:26:15,210 --> 00:26:17,462
you'll lose them all again!

553
00:26:17,546 --> 00:26:20,882
Not fair! It's like facing the final boss
with level one weapon.

554
00:26:20,966 --> 00:26:22,009
That's bad, right?

555
00:26:22,092 --> 00:26:23,760
And if you finish high school

556
00:26:23,844 --> 00:26:25,470
and you're still alone,

557
00:26:25,554 --> 00:26:28,473
well, then they'll be confiscated forever!

558
00:26:28,557 --> 00:26:30,434
[growls]
What?

559
00:26:31,143 --> 00:26:34,771
I told you before,
I will not be forced into a relationship!

560
00:26:35,272 --> 00:26:38,775
You'll see! I will not lose,
I'll win this project!

561
00:26:38,859 --> 00:26:41,903
Ah! Anzu, you're so bold, I love it!

562
00:26:42,529 --> 00:26:44,072
And let's not forget, you two,

563
00:26:44,156 --> 00:26:47,242
that there's still a possibility
that Anzu ends up with me!

564
00:26:47,326 --> 00:26:49,911
[giggles]
So, don't take it personally, okay?

565
00:26:49,995 --> 00:26:52,289
You've done good but my kiss
is hard to compete with,

566
00:26:52,372 --> 00:26:53,707
plus we've already kissed twice.

567
00:26:53,790 --> 00:26:55,792
[in deep voice]
Do something about your mouth,

568
00:26:55,876 --> 00:26:57,002
-or I will.
-[babbling]

569
00:26:57,085 --> 00:27:00,630
Oh! Right here in front of everyone?
Are you sure?

570
00:27:00,714 --> 00:27:03,133
[Anzu] Knock it off! You know what I mean!

571
00:27:03,216 --> 00:27:05,052
[Riri] You're blushing!
Are you embarrassed?

572
00:27:05,135 --> 00:27:06,511
[Anzu] I'm not blushing!

573
00:27:07,429 --> 00:27:10,349
MEDICAL CENTER

574
00:27:10,432 --> 00:27:13,352
My next subject
should be around here somewhere.

575
00:27:14,353 --> 00:27:15,937
-[wand beeping]
-Oh, there she is.

576
00:27:16,980 --> 00:27:19,733
[Kate] Hopefully
she's not as difficult to work with.

577
00:27:22,694 --> 00:27:24,696
[theme music]

578
00:27:52,724 --> 00:27:56,895
[Riri] Anzu's wonderful
and oh, so romantic developments

579
00:27:56,978 --> 00:28:00,941
are slowly progressing as we speak.
[chuckles]

